Why Is the Residential Energy Storage All-in-One Machine Market Growing?
One of the principal growth drivers is the increasing demand for residential energy independence. Homeowners are becoming more interested in storing surplus solar electricity for use during evenings, peak-price periods, and grid outages. Integrated storage systems allow households to improve the utilization of locally generated renewable electricity while reducing dependence on conventional grid power.
